{"id":"9535688e55559250","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-boolean-valued.md","title":"Boolean-Valued Model","display":"df-boolean-valued — Boolean-Valued Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-boolean-valued","aliases":["58-df-boolean-valued"],"display":"df-boolean-valued — Boolean-Valued Model","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-boolean-valued"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-boolean-valued</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-boolean-valued — Boolean-Valued Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a5e10857074b912e\" href=\"?note=a5e10857074b912e\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\">\\(\\mathbb B=(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\)</span> (Boolean-algebra datum)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\mathbb B}\">\\(\\leq_{\\mathbb B}\\)</span> where <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\leq_{\\mathbb B}b\\leftrightarrow a\\wedge b=a\">\\(a\\leq_{\\mathbb B}b\\leftrightarrow a\\wedge b=a\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V^{\\mathbb B}_\\alpha\">\\(V^{\\mathbb B}_\\alpha\\)</span> (rank-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> hierarchy of Boolean-valued names)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Boolean},\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Boolean},\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteBoolean}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteBoolean}_S\\)</span> (completeness predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BValuedName}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BValuedName}_S\\)</span> (Boolean-valued-name predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathcal M\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V^{\\mathbb B}\">\\(\\mathcal V^{\\mathbb B}\\)</span> 为类变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BooleanValuedUniverse}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}\\times V\">\\(\\mathrm{BooleanValuedUniverse}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}\\times V\\)</span> 为下式给出的类层兼容接口。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in V\">\\(\\tau\\in V\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>每一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\alpha^{\\mathbb B}\">\\(V_\\alpha^{\\mathbb B}\\)</span> 的右侧限制于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P((\\bigcup_{\\beta\\in\\alpha}V_\\beta^{\\mathbb B})\\times B)\">\\(\\mathcal P((\\bigcup_{\\beta\\in\\alpha}V_\\beta^{\\mathbb B})\\times B)\\)</span>；因此为集合，递归按序数进行。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V^{\\mathbb B}\">\\(\\mathcal V^{\\mathbb B}\\)</span> 只由集合元素的成员条件给出。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{meta}\">\\(\\mathrm{meta}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean-valued} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompleteBoolean}_S(\\mathbb B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq B\\;\\exists s\\in B\\;\\Bigl(\\forall a\\in A\\;(a\\leq_{\\mathbb B}s)\\land\\forall u\\in B\\;\\bigl((\\forall a\\in A\\;(a\\leq_{\\mathbb B}u))\\to s\\leq_{\\mathbb B}u\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean-valued} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompleteBoolean}_S(\\mathbb B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq B\\;\\exists s\\in B\\;\\Bigl(\\forall a\\in A\\;(a\\leq_{\\mathbb B}s)\\land\\forall u\\in B\\;\\bigl((\\forall a\\in A\\;(a\\leq_{\\mathbb B}u))\\to s\\leq_{\\mathbb B}u\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean-valued} \\vdash \\forall\\alpha\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to V^{\\mathbb B}_\\alpha=\\left\\{\\tau\\in\\mathcal P((\\bigcup_{\\beta\\in\\alpha}V^{\\mathbb B}_\\beta)\\times B)\\ \\middle|\\ \\mathrm{Function}(\\tau,\\operatorname{dom}(\\tau),B)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\tau)\\subseteq\\bigcup_{\\beta\\in\\alpha}V^{\\mathbb B}_\\beta\\right\\}\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean-valued} \\vdash \\forall\\alpha\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to V^{\\mathbb B}_\\alpha=\\left\\{\\tau\\in\\mathcal P((\\bigcup_{\\beta\\in\\alpha}V^{\\mathbb B}_\\beta)\\times B)\\ \\middle|\\ \\mathrm{Function}(\\tau,\\operatorname{dom}(\\tau),B)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\tau)\\subseteq\\bigcup_{\\beta\\in\\alpha}V^{\\mathbb B}_\\beta\\right\\}\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean-valued} \\vdash \\mathrm{BValuedName}_S(\\tau,\\mathbb B)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\tau\\in V^{\\mathbb B}_\\alpha\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean-valued} \\vdash \\mathrm{BValuedName}_S(\\tau,\\mathbb B)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\tau\\in V^{\\mathbb B}_\\alpha\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}valued\\text{-}universe} \\vdash \\tau\\in\\mathcal V^{\\mathbb B}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CompleteBoolean}_S(\\mathbb B)\\land\\mathrm{BValuedName}_S(\\tau,\\mathbb B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}valued\\text{-}universe} \\vdash \\tau\\in\\mathcal V^{\\mathbb B}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CompleteBoolean}_S(\\mathbb B)\\land\\mathrm{BValuedName}_S(\\tau,\\mathbb B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}valued\\text{-}universe\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{BooleanValuedUniverse}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathbb B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CompleteBoolean}_S(\\mathbb B)\\land\n\\forall\\tau\\in V\\;(\\tau\\in\\mathcal M\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BValuedName}_S(\\tau,\\mathbb B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}valued\\text{-}universe\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{BooleanValuedUniverse}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathbb B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CompleteBoolean}_S(\\mathbb B)\\land\n\\forall\\tau\\in V\\;(\\tau\\in\\mathcal M\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BValuedName}_S(\\tau,\\mathbb B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个名字层级是集合；全部名字构成类。保留的二元宇宙接口接受类类型首参，并不声称这个类是集合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a5e10857074b912e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb B=(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_{\\mathbb B}","display":false},{"tex":"a\\leq_{\\mathbb B}b\\leftrightarrow a\\wedge b=a","display":false},{"tex":"V^{\\mathbb B}_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Boolean},\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompleteBoolean}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BValuedName}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V^{\\mathbb B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BooleanValuedUniverse}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}\\times V","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"V_\\alpha^{\\mathbb B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P((\\bigcup_{\\beta\\in\\alpha}V_\\beta^{\\mathbb B})\\times B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V^{\\mathbb B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{meta}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean-valued} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompleteBoolean}_S(\\mathbb B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq B\\;\\exists s\\in B\\;\\Bigl(\\forall a\\in A\\;(a\\leq_{\\mathbb B}s)\\land\\forall u\\in B\\;\\bigl((\\forall a\\in A\\;(a\\leq_{\\mathbb B}u))\\to s\\leq_{\\mathbb B}u\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean-valued} \\vdash \\forall\\alpha\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to V^{\\mathbb B}_\\alpha=\\left\\{\\tau\\in\\mathcal P((\\bigcup_{\\beta\\in\\alpha}V^{\\mathbb B}_\\beta)\\times B)\\ \\middle|\\ \\mathrm{Function}(\\tau,\\operatorname{dom}(\\tau),B)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\tau)\\subseteq\\bigcup_{\\beta\\in\\alpha}V^{\\mathbb B}_\\beta\\right\\}\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean-valued} \\vdash \\mathrm{BValuedName}_S(\\tau,\\mathbb B)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\tau\\in V^{\\mathbb B}_\\alpha\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}valued\\text{-}universe} \\vdash \\tau\\in\\mathcal V^{\\mathbb B}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CompleteBoolean}_S(\\mathbb B)\\land\\mathrm{BValuedName}_S(\\tau,\\mathbb B)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}valued\\text{-}universe\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{BooleanValuedUniverse}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathbb B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CompleteBoolean}_S(\\mathbb B)\\land\n\\forall\\tau\\in V\\;(\\tau\\in\\mathcal M\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BValuedName}_S(\\tau,\\mathbb B)).","display":true}],"bytes":2949,"backlinks":[{"id":"b153b750ecf2b78b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CompleteBoolean}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-boolean-valued.md]])"},{"id":"87811b9038822859","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CompleteBoolean}_S$, $\\mathrm{BValuedName}_S$, and $\\mathrm{BooleanValuedUniverse}_S$ are from [[../batch11/58-df-boolean-valued.